HLA-WM Top1 inference: Stage 1, AR refinement, or bidirectional refinement.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --image IMAGE         First-frame RGB image. (default: None)
  --prompt PROMPT       UTF-8 text file with the prompt. (default: None)
  --output_dir OUTPUT_DIR
                        Directory to write the progressive mp4. (default:
                        None)
  --name NAME           Filename stem for outputs. (default: output)
  --camera CAMERA       (F,4,4) .npy camera-to-world poses. (default: None)
  --action ACTION       Action DSL string, e.g. 'w-120,lw-80,...'. Rolled out
                        internally. (default: None)
  --translation_speed TRANSLATION_SPEED
                        Per-frame translation magnitude when --action is used.
                        (default: 0.025)
  --rotation_speed_deg ROTATION_SPEED_DEG
                        Per-frame rotation magnitude (degrees) when --action
                        is used. (default: 0.6)
  --intrinsics INTRINSICS
                        (3,3), (F,3,3), or (4,) intrinsics .npy.
                        Pi3X-estimated if omitted. (default: None)
  --num_frames NUM_FRAMES
                        Total pixel frames (~15s @16fps; 241 = 24*10+1).
                        Snapped to 8*refiner_block_size*k+1 so the VAE and
                        refiner chunking divide evenly. (default: 241)
  --fps FPS
  --cfg_scale CFG_SCALE
  --flow_shift FLOW_SHIFT
  --seed SEED
  --negative_prompt NEGATIVE_PROMPT
  --streaming_root STREAMING_ROOT
                        Optional LOCAL bundle dir holding sana_dit/,
                        ltx2_causal_vae/, refiner_diffusers/, gemma3_12b/. If
                        unset, each artefact is fetched from hf://Efficient-
                        Large-Model/SANA-WM_streaming. (default: None)
  --config CONFIG       Streaming YAML (local path or hf:// URI). Default: in-
                        repo configs/sana_wm/sana_wm_streaming_1600m_720p.yaml
                        (or <streaming_root>/sana_wm_streaming_1600m_720p.yaml
                        when --streaming_root is set). (default: None)
  --model_path MODEL_PATH
                        Override the streaming DiT checkpoint (local path or
                        hf:// URI). Default: hf://Efficient-Large-Model/SANA-
                        WM_streaming/sana_dit/model.pt. (default: None)
  --causal_vae_path CAUSAL_VAE_PATH
                        Override the causal LTX-2 VAE (local path or hf://
                        URI). Default: hf://Efficient-Large-Model/SANA-
                        WM_streaming/ltx2_causal_vae. (default: None)
  --refiner_root REFINER_ROOT
                        Override the chunk-causal refiner (local path or hf://
                        URI). Default: hf://Efficient-Large-Model/SANA-
                        WM_streaming/refiner_diffusers. (default: None)
  --refiner_gemma_root REFINER_GEMMA_ROOT
                        Override the Gemma diffusers root (local path or hf://
                        URI). Default: hf://Efficient-Large-Model/SANA-
                        WM_streaming/gemma3_12b. (default: None)
  --denoising_step_list DENOISING_STEP_LIST
                        Comma-separated distilled-student timestep schedule
                        (must end with 0). (default: 1000,960,889,727,0)
  --num_frame_per_block NUM_FRAME_PER_BLOCK
                        Latent frames per stage-1 AR chunk (must match the
                        model's chunk_size). (default: 3)
  --refiner_block_size REFINER_BLOCK_SIZE
                        Refiner latent frames per AR block. (default: 3)
  --refiner_kv_max_frames REFINER_KV_MAX_FRAMES
                        Refiner KV sliding-window size (sink + history +
                        active). (default: 11)
  --refiner_seed REFINER_SEED
  --sink_size SINK_SIZE
  --no_sink_token       Disable the stage-1 sink token (default: enabled).
                        (default: False)
  --num_cached_blocks NUM_CACHED_BLOCKS
                        Stage-1 KV sliding-window size (-1 keeps all past
                        chunks). (default: 2)
  --streaming_crf STREAMING_CRF
                        ffmpeg CRF for the progressive MP4 (lower = higher
                        quality). (default: 18)
  --streaming_preset STREAMING_PRESET
                        ffmpeg libx264 preset for the progressive MP4 writer.
                        (default: medium)
  --streaming_encoder STREAMING_ENCODER
                        MP4 encoder: libx264 or h264_nvenc. (default: libx264)
  --output_mode {mp4,cpu,discard}
                        mp4 writes H.264, cpu copies decoded uint8 frames to
                        host without writing, discard decodes on GPU and drops
                        frames after synchronization. (default: mp4)
  --no_mp4              Alias for --output_mode=discard; excludes uint8 CPU
                        transfer and MP4 encoding from timings. (default:
                        False)
  --benchmark_json BENCHMARK_JSON
                        Optional JSON file with wall-clock throughput metrics.
                        (default: None)
  --benchmark_repeats BENCHMARK_REPEATS
                        Run generation this many times in one process; useful
                        for warm/steady benchmark separation. (default: 1)
  --profile_cuda        Record per-stage CUDA event timings; useful for
                        bottleneck breakdown but disabled by default for pure
                        throughput. (default: False)
  --sample_frames_npz SAMPLE_FRAMES_NPZ
                        Optional .npz path for sampled decoded uint8 frames.
                        (default: None)
  --sample_frame_stride SAMPLE_FRAME_STRIDE
                        Save every Nth output frame when --sample_frames_npz
                        is set. (default: 16)
  --no_compile          Disable torch.compile for smoke/debug runs. (default:
                        False)
  --offload_vae         Move the VAE to CPU between encode/decode steps.
                        (default: False)
  --offload_refiner     Lazy-load the LTX-2 refiner only when needed; release
                        afterwards. (default: False)
  --offload_text_encoder
                        Move the stage-1 text encoder to CPU after prompt
                        encoding to save GPU memory. (default: False)
  --stage1_precision {bf16,fp8,fp4}
                        Stage-1 DiT compute precision. bf16 (default, any
                        GPU); fp8 = FP8 W8A8 (Hopper+ / Blackwell); fp4 =
                        NVFP4 W4A4 (Blackwell only). Quantizes self-attn +
                        cross-attn + FFN, per-block scoped. Needs Transformer
                        Engine. (default: bf16)
  --refiner_precision {bf16,fp8,fp4}
                        LTX-2 refiner compute precision. bf16 (default, any
                        GPU); fp8 = FP8 W8A8 (Hopper+ / Blackwell); fp4 =
                        NVFP4 W4A4 (Blackwell only). Needs Transformer Engine.
                        (default: bf16)
  --mode {stage1,ar,bi}
  --baseline
  --median-depth MEDIAN_DEPTH
                        Scene depth in camera translation units (default: 3.0)
